  "cross_group_constraints": [
    "Input current: USB/bench selector → charger → SYS → buckboost / amplifier, so place in roughly that order.",
    "Battery and NTC terminal blocks adjacent to one another with clear polarity; gauge and comparator on quiet interior side, charger on power side.",
    "Distribute domain switches near corresponding loads if this keeps high-current and low-voltage routes shorter; schematic row order is not a required physical row.",
    "Measurement jumpers and selection headers must stay accessible from board top, without FPC/cable insertion area crossing them.",
    "Do not claim routed current capacity, thermal design, impedance, analog thresholds or charging operation from placement alone."
  ],
